<title>UK: DePfa unit adds 50 mln guilders to Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa unit adds 50 mln guilders to Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 250 million guilders from 200 million guilders, lead manager Rabobank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEPFA FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DEPFA BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT  **250 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    20.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.155   PAY DATE   *22.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.58     SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> NOTES    **200 MLN DFL BOND ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON 23.JAN.97</p>
<p>	     *PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST FROM MARCH 3</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
